    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<strong>Before the missionaries came to the Slavic lands to start writing down the known history, there was the <i>Age of Mythos:</i> </strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570220/extras/dd8d05fc03f3f1c2c9f477b0c4396342.poster.avif?t=1728981589\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570220/extras/dd8d05fc03f3f1c2c9f477b0c4396342.webm?t=1728981589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><i>Forests, valleys and fields are full of creatures from Slavic beliefs. Even though they may look like monsters, you don't have to fight them all. Make proper offerings to them and you will gain powerful allies. </i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570220/extras/a0b2f3a02b6bfd4a3587da63163ea551.poster.avif?t=1728981589\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570220/extras/a0b2f3a02b6bfd4a3587da63163ea551.webm?t=1728981589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><i>Give your workers a roof over their heads and a good supper and they will build a thriving settlement for you. Do not disappoint your subjects, because dissatisfied people may leave you. </i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570220/extras/17a617399007c348b93da490b1ec5b56.poster.avif?t=1728981589\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570220/extras/17a617399007c348b93da490b1ec5b56.webm?t=1728981589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><i>A long spear and a sharp sword will always be useful - your settlement is threatened by monsters, other tribes, Vikings or even demons from distant lands. </i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570220/extras/128b4a8446044ebb9cb1d58e61f775dd.poster.avif?t=1728981589\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570220/extras/128b4a8446044ebb9cb1d58e61f775dd.webm?t=1728981589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><i>Follow Slavic traditions to earn points that you may spend on special blessings from the gods - the warlike Perun, the generous Mokosh and the mysterious Veles.</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Before the missionaries came to the Slavic lands to start writing down the known history, there was the <i>Age of Mythos:</i> </strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570220/extras/dd8d05fc03f3f1c2c9f477b0c4396342.poster.avif?t=1728981589\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570220/extras/dd8d05fc03f3f1c2c9f477b0c4396342.webm?t=1728981589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><i>Forests, valleys and fields are full of creatures from Slavic beliefs. Even though they may look like monsters, you don't have to fight them all. Make proper offerings to them and you will gain powerful allies. </i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570220/extras/a0b2f3a02b6bfd4a3587da63163ea551.poster.avif?t=1728981589\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570220/extras/a0b2f3a02b6bfd4a3587da63163ea551.webm?t=1728981589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><i>Give your workers a roof over their heads and a good supper and they will build a thriving settlement for you. Do not disappoint your subjects, because dissatisfied people may leave you. </i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570220/extras/17a617399007c348b93da490b1ec5b56.poster.avif?t=1728981589\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570220/extras/17a617399007c348b93da490b1ec5b56.webm?t=1728981589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><i>A long spear and a sharp sword will always be useful - your settlement is threatened by monsters, other tribes, Vikings or even demons from distant lands. </i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570220/extras/128b4a8446044ebb9cb1d58e61f775dd.poster.avif?t=1728981589\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570220/extras/128b4a8446044ebb9cb1d58e61f775dd.webm?t=1728981589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><i>Follow Slavic traditions to earn points that you may spend on special blessings from the gods - the warlike Perun, the generous Mokosh and the mysterious Veles.</i>",
    "short_description": "Mythos Slavic Builder is a combination of classic real-time strategy games and it's based on Slavic mythology. Grow your settlement, build up the economy, army and explore maps guarded by mythical creatures &amp; other clans.",
